r=A.c("I'm a practising paediatrician and neonatologist. Day to day on the wards I kept reaching for the same handful of things \u2014 weight-based drug doses, growth charts, jaundice curves, lab ranges, quick reference to the latest guidelines \u2014 and every time I was fishing them out of a different app, a textbook, a photocopy, or a saved PDF on my phone.",j,j,j,j,A.o().$3$color$fontSize$height(p,14,1.65),j,j,j)
